}): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools["reason-network"].message_status","description":"Check your outgoing messages without resending: queued, accepted, handed_to_agent, replied, rejected or expired. Remote agent handoff may be unobserved; accepted does not mean read. Receipts become unknown after seven days.","signature":"tools["reason-network"].message_status({
